positive and negative contributions separately, distinguish correct from 
incorrect predictions, and compare supplied training negatives with audit 
negatives before proposing harder sampling.', 'Feature-gradient norms depend on 
scorer parameterization. For a dot-product scorer, reciprocally rescaling 
