must train variants separately, never fuse their predictions, and deploy exactly
one checkpoint per category. State trial limits, budget allocation, validation 
schedule and selection rules.', 'Baseline preservation currently concerns 
initial forward computation only. Added Linear constructors consume random 
numbers before their weights are zeroed, potentially changing later backbone 
